## Commands

```bash
make up          # start infra + backend
make dev         # backend on host, watch mode
make migrate     # apply migrations
make db-check    # verify DB + extensions
cd backend && npm run export:static   # regenerate the static site
npm test         # Playwright suites
```

## Hard rules

- **Never edit `static-export/`** — generated, gitignored, wiped every run. Fix the
  generator (`backend/scripts/export-static.ts`) and regenerate.
- **Never enable TypeORM `synchronize`.** Schema changes are migrations only.
- Build production with `SITE_URL=<SITE_URL>`; build staging with `STAGING=1` (adds noindex).
- The export is root-absolute — it **must** be served from a domain root.
- Regenerating needs Postgres up (`make up`) — the export reads from the database.

